msgid "Additive process attribution"
msgstr "加性过程归属"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:84
#: f481dad684744511879130abd0b56958
msgid ""
"How should system performance be distributed across processes according to "
"their fitted virtual-resource shares?"
msgstr "应如何按照拟合的虚拟资源份额，把系统绩效分配到各过程？"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:84
#: f8c9fec104974c24b89fb41b50498850
msgid "stage efficiencies and endogenous shares"
msgstr "阶段效率与内生份额"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:84
#: 8b124e6241e64dbbb18c36b6b75b19f0
msgid ""
"the shares are not observed budgets, stated priorities, or causal "
"contributions"
msgstr "这些份额不是实际预算、声明的优先级或因果贡献"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:165
#: 31ed9769a0114ee9ba0b0c67f8b64d3c
msgid "System-only radial performance"
msgstr "仅报告系统的径向绩效"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:167
#: d4ee73b1de184889accc97f217fbf8c5
msgid ""
"The system-radial model reports $\\theta_o$ for the resource-saving question"
" or $\\phi_o$ for the service-expansion question. To keep comparisons "
"running in one direction, the reported system efficiency is $\\theta_o$ "
"under input orientation and $1/\\phi_o$ under output orientation. Under a "
"matched self-inclusive comparison it is ordinarily between zero and one, and"
" larger values mean better performance. The result can show the upstream "
"peer plan, downstream peer plan, external targets, and link supply and "
"requirement."
msgstr ""
"系统径向模型针对资源节约问题报告 $\\theta_o$，针对服务扩张问题报告 $\\phi_o$。为了让比较方向保持一致，投入导向报告的系统效率是 "
"$\\theta_o$，产出导向则为 "
"$1/\\phi_o$。在口径匹配且包含被评价单元自身的比较中，效率通常介于零与一之间，数值越大表示绩效越好。结果可以展示上游参照方案、下游参照方案、外部目标，以及联结变量的供给量与需求量。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:175
#: f009a9bbc8e142869f8df48cbc3dde47
msgid ""
"It deliberately does not assign an efficiency score to either process. A "
"coefficient in the research peer plan describes part of a feasible "
"comparator activity. It does not measure research management's contribution "
"to the organization's shortfall."
msgstr "该模型有意不为任何过程分配效率值。研究过程参照方案中的某个系数，只描述一个可行比较方案中的部分活动，并不衡量研究管理对组织绩效不足的贡献。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:180
#: 1126f64527254c8c9adc0216d37a06f4
msgid "Relational product performance"
msgstr "关系乘积型绩效"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:182
#: af6cc5324d98436cad854cc68b8a5226
msgid ""
"A relational account places nonnegative multipliers $v$, $w$, and $u$ on "
"external resources, intermediate quantities, and final outcomes. For a "
"closed two-stage CRS system, the process accounts are"
msgstr "关系型账户分别给外部资源、中间产品和最终成果赋予非负乘数 $v$、$w$ 与 $u$。对于封闭的两阶段 CRS 系统，过程账户为"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:186
#: 0b499f160c1b4bdbb0df679bc7f2d3ec
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_o^{(1)}=\\frac{w^\\top z_o}{v^\\top x_o},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_o^{(2)}=\\frac{u^\\top y_o}{w^\\top z_o}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_o^{(1)}=\\frac{w^\\top z_o}{v^\\top x_o},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"E_o^{(2)}=\\frac{u^\\top y_o}{w^\\top z_o}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:192
#: 282ec7d51fba4507abdf99b8564e3527
msgid ""
"The same $w$ values the handoff leaving process 1 and entering process 2. "
"This prevents the two processes from choosing unrelated internal valuations."
" When the intermediate virtual value is positive, it cancels from the "
"complete system account:"
msgstr ""
"同一个 $w$ 既对离开过程 1 的内部交付估值，也对进入过程 2 "
"的内部交付估值，从而避免两个过程选择互不相关的内部估值。当中间产品的虚拟价值为正时，它在完整系统账户中约去："

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:197
#: 5005e53b24924fa9ab6d92be9f17c126
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_o\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{u^\\top y_o}{v^\\top x_o}\n"
"=\n"
"E_o^{(1)}E_o^{(2)}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_o\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{u^\\top y_o}{v^\\top x_o}\n"
"=\n"
"E_o^{(1)}E_o^{(2)}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:205
#: 94153e83c3684f078d21a017d85af403
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The product identity is the defining performance account for this closed "
"relational construction {cite:p}`kao2008`. It is not a universal law for "
"every network technology. The multiplier $w$ is an endogenous supporting "
"valuation, not an internal transfer price, a causal marginal product, or a "
"priority elicited from management."
msgstr ""
"这一乘积恒等式是封闭关系型构造的定义性绩效账户 {cite:p}`kao2008`，并非适用于所有网络技术的普遍规律。乘数 $w$ "
"是模型内生的支撑性估值，不是内部转移价格、因果边际产出，也不是向管理层征询得到的优先级。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:211
#: 96cf896e050348c3b6e3e73aaace96b8
msgid ""
"Under matched CRS assumptions, the primary relational system programme and "
"the preceding system-radial programme have the same optimal system score. "
"Their reports are still different. The relational account adds process "
"ratios and a selection among admissible process attributions; the system-"
"only account does not make those claims."
msgstr ""
"在相互匹配的 CRS "
"假设下，主要的关系型系统规划与前述系统径向规划具有相同的最优系统效率值，但二者的报告内容仍然不同。关系型账户增加了过程比率，并从可接受的过程归属中选出一组结果；仅报告系统的账户则不作这些判断。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:219
#: 339dba9dce8749a78402b2b187d01e19
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An additive network account asks how much each process counts in the fitted "
"system assessment. Let $A_{ko}$ be the virtual resource account of process "
"$k$ and $B_{ko}$ its virtual result account. When $A_{ko}>0$, its fitted "
"process efficiency is"
msgstr ""
"加性网络账户考察每个过程在拟合的系统评价中占多大比重。令 $A_{ko}$ 为过程 $k$ 的虚拟资源账户，$B_{ko}$ 为其虚拟成果账户。当 "
"$A_{ko}>0$ 时，拟合的过程效率为"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:224
#: 12e79f20c05844e5844df3f880d81bdd
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_{ko}=\\frac{B_{ko}}{A_{ko}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_{ko}=\\frac{B_{ko}}{A_{ko}}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:228
#: bb9114b17ebc47d2bad079d792fbf17a
msgid "Normalizing the combined virtual resources gives endogenous process shares"
msgstr "把合并后的虚拟资源标准化，得到内生过程份额"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:230
#: abe317120abc478ba4c7847f0291aa3f
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\alpha_{ko}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{A_{ko}}{\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{K}A_{\\ell o}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\alpha_{ko}=1,\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\alpha_{ko}\n"
"=\n"
"\\frac{A_{ko}}{\\sum_{\\ell=1}^{K}A_{\\ell o}},\n"
"\\qquad\n"
"\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\alpha_{ko}=1,\n"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:238
#: 6453c2342eac4d3d8fd11a0cd0dc65a8
msgid "and the system account is"
msgstr "系统账户为"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:240
#: 371bc9e4aa12459d8e09262207759f25
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"E_o=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\alpha_{ko}E_{ko}.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"E_o=\\sum_{k=1}^{K}\\alpha_{ko}E_{ko}.\n"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:244
#: 2cbf5ee7446e48cc9f9b5a98d9185c8d
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is an arithmetic attribution of system performance, not the ordinary "
"additive DEA model that sums physical input excesses and output shortfalls. "
"The $\\alpha_{ko}$ are fitted virtual-resource shares. A reported share of "
"0.60 does not mean that a department receives 60 percent of the observed "
"budget or that executives regard it as 60 percent important "
"{cite:p}`chen2009additive,cook2010additive`."
msgstr ""
"这是对系统绩效的算术归属，不是把实物投入冗余与产出不足相加的普通加性 DEA 模型。$\\alpha_{ko}$ 是拟合得到的虚拟资源份额。报告份额为 "
"0.60，并不表示某部门获得实际预算的 60%，也不表示高管认为它具有 60% 的重要性 "
"{cite:p}`chen2009additive,cook2010additive`。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:251
#: 7198e228db8d4eb8b77e075ba294c3c9
msgid ""
"The additive principle extends naturally from a closed two-stage chain to an"
" open directed network: external resources enter the virtual input account "
"of the process that receives them, external results enter the virtual output"
" account of the process that creates them, and each internal link retains a "
"common valuation at its two endpoints."
msgstr "加性原则可以自然地从封闭两阶段链推广到开放的有向网络：外部资源进入实际接收它的过程之虚拟投入账户，外部成果进入实际创造它的过程之虚拟产出账户，每项内部联结在两个端点则保持共同估值。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:257
#: 82d720da894a4c5793c6fc4f8765a996
msgid ""
"The same research and commercialization chain supports a system-only radial "
"account, a relational product account, and an endogenous-share additive "
"process attribution"
msgstr "同一条研究—商业化过程链，可以支持仅报告系统的径向账户、关系乘积账户，以及基于内生份额的加性过程归属"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:262
#: a90c2a344da942b4b6ebe499ba3d105f
msgid ""
"The graph and the performance account answer different questions. A common "
"chain does not make a board-level radial score, a relational product, and an"
" additive process attribution interchangeable."
msgstr "过程图与绩效账户回答不同问题。即使过程链相同，董事会层面的径向效率值、关系乘积和加性过程归属也不能互换。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:267
#: 6c0e9f67a24640f7920f3c0552498ab0
msgid "One organization, three management questions"
msgstr "一个组织，三个管理问题"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:269
#: 83255f9efb934237b58515af5b581612
msgid ""
"The bundled `network_2stage` data describe eight research organizations. "
"Research staff and budget create patents and prototypes; those innovations "
"are handed to commercialization, which produces sales and a commercial-reach"
" measure. The dataset is deterministic and intended to expose model "
"mechanisms. In an empirical application, a percentage such as market share "
"is a ratio variable and must not be treated as freely additive or scalable "
"without a separate production-account justification."
msgstr ""
"内置的 `network_2stage` "
"数据描述了八家研究组织。研究人员与经费创造专利和原型，这些创新被交付给商业化过程，后者产生销售额和商业覆盖度指标。该数据集是确定性的，旨在揭示模型机制。在实证应用中，市场份额之类的百分比是比率变量；如果没有另外说明生产账户依据，就不能把它视为可自由相加或按比例缩放的变量。"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:277
#: dce5ed00c8e347e3b3c698bcf075ad48
msgid ""
"The organizational graph is declared once. Nothing about the research-to- "
"commercialization handoff changes when the board changes the reporting "
"question:"
msgstr "组织过程图只需声明一次。当董事会改变报告问题时，研究到商业化的内部交付关系本身并没有改变："

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:302
#: 384b945fe60e4fe0ba248db808950bb4
msgid ""
"Start with the board-level resource question. The model permits research and"
" commercialization to learn from different peer combinations, but it "
"requires their selected innovation handoff to coexist in one feasible "
"organization:"
msgstr "先从董事会层面的资源问题开始。模型允许研究过程和商业化过程向不同的参照单元组合学习，但要求二者选定的创新交付方案能够在同一个可行组织中共存："

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:328
#: 98f9fead0f7c410da76befa2c734894a
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "组织"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:329
#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:389
#: 1607000aeb384db09a6571576df32f84 3a0bead9441c4c0c9cdcaeaa698cd5c5
msgid "System efficiency"
msgstr "系统效率"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:330
#: 620b1de3a73e4a89b74505838dce7fdb
msgid "Board-level reading"
msgstr "董事会层面的解释"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:331
#: a274afa8b15b4d8fb23c638796185377
msgid "A"
msgstr "A"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:332
#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:394
#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:399
#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:400
#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:405
#: 0033094687b14ecf91108dc2b1e6fde2 4a6a591b63304e16885373e3145aac2b
#: 797cdda8d7f34ee6b3ccd52e6363d289 95b1f276a7174fdeafc6e319ef53a15c
#: b1d4eaa0b0594cbe841a536462ad83f2
msgid "0.8333"
msgstr "0.8333"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:333
#: 5a37496f5e314f64b5e26c0960f3dc3d
msgid ""
"The coordinated benchmark protects final results with 83.33 percent of the "
"external resource commitment"
msgstr "协调标杆以 83.33% 的外部资源承诺保护最终成果"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:335
#: 038c004ccdc34158a2afcf1a80d2a210
msgid "D"
msgstr "D"

#: ../../chapters/05-network/network-dea-organizations-links-responsibility.md:336
#: 5f7a6201b62942f8a76c8e341eb076ad
